      "lang": "en",
      "notes": [
         {
            "category": "description",
            "text": "Image::WebP versions before 0.3.0 for Perl bundle a vulnerable version of libwebp.\n\nImage::WebP does not link to the system libwebp. Instead, it uses a bundled copy of libwebp 0.3.0 (released 2013-03-20). That version has multiple known vulnerabilities, including CVE-2023-4863.\n\nAny caller that decodes an untrusted WebP image reaches the bundled decoder. Because the library is compiled into the module, upgrading the system libwebp does not remediate this.",
            "title": "Vulnerability Description"
         }
      ],
